{"tool_name":"jipipe:-visual-batch-processing-for-imagej","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>JIPipe is a visual programming language to realize code-free workflow building for ImageJ-based image analyses. GUI, graphical user interface.&nbsp;Currently, JIPipe unifies the functionality of over 1,000 ImageJ commands into a standardized interface, represented as nodes in the pipeline flow chart. The window-based data management implemented in ImageJ is replaced with a table-based model designed for batch processing.&nbsp;JIPipe is also available from within the ImageJ update service.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>JIPipe is a visual programming language to realize code-free workflow building for ImageJ-based image analyses. GUI, graphical user interface.&nbsp;Currently, JIPipe unifies the functionality of over 1,000 ImageJ commands into a standardized interface, represented as nodes in the pipeline flow chart. The window-based data management implemented in ImageJ is replaced with a table-based model designed for batch processing.&nbsp;JIPipe is also available from within the ImageJ update service.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-29T09:11:20+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-29T08:51:12+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":5109,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"bb2faf2f-043d-4d58-9810-a5a971b9b562","url":"/taxonomy/term/5109"},{"target_id":5110,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"4c0d504a-4ac4-4bf1-b495-12bd13c071f1","url":"/taxonomy/term/5110"},{"target_id":3599,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"9452479a-42da-42cf-a214-898c8df8025c","url":"/taxonomy/term/3599"},{"target_id":4496,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"3cd49b3f-f3e2-43ab-90c2-efc9c155f225","url":"/taxonomy/term/4496"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0